                <pb facs="0642" n="560" xml:id="pg560"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1216M/237.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-02-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 25,
                    1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Replying to Department’s telegram of the 22d instant Chargé Dearing reports that
                    the Mexican Government agrees to all the proposals contained in that
                    telegram.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
